a_{1}+a_{2}+\cdots+a_{k}+a_{k+1}=\frac{\sin\frac{k\alpha}{2}\cos\frac{k+1}{2}\alpha}{\sin\frac{\alpha}{2}}+\cos(k+1)\alpha,\\
